captures
# Working directory for on-device design reviews: screenshots, UI-hierarchy dumps and the one-off
# scripts used to drive them. Never source. Everything in here is reproducible by rerunning the
# review, and screenshots in particular go stale the moment a token changes, so a committed one is
# worse than none — it documents a version of the UI that no longer exists.
#
# Kept as a single directory rather than a scattering of ignored names so that clearing it is one
# deletion and nothing accumulates unnoticed at the repo root.
.scratch
.externalNativeBuild
.cxx
*.xcodeproj/*
!*.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj
!*.xcodeproj/xcshareddata/
!*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/
!*.xcworkspace/contents.xcworkspacedata
**/xcshareddata/WorkspaceSettings.xcsettings
